{"nodes": [{"id": "front_src_solveur_readme_solveur", "label": "Le solveur de repas (module TypeScript autonome)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "front/src/solveur/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Il tourne c\u00f4t\u00e9 client : le calcul est instantan\u00e9 et fonctionne hors ligne. L'arbre de ce README annon\u00e7ait cinq fichiers jusqu'au 16 septembre 2026 alors que le dossier en contient dix-sept."}, {"id": "front_src_solveur_readme_algebre_gauss", "label": "Syst\u00e8me 3\u00d73 r\u00e9solu par \u00e9limination de Gauss \u00e0 pivot partiel", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "front/src/solveur/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Trois inconnues, trois \u00e9quations : r\u00e9solution exacte, aucune it\u00e9ration, aucune approximation, aucun risque de non-convergence."}, {"id": "front_src_solveur_readme_roles", "label": "Les r\u00f4les : prot\u00e9ine, glucide, lipide et les fixes", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "front/src/solveur/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "front_src_solveur_readme_restes_cru_cuit", "label": "\u00c9couler les restes \u2014 toute quantit\u00e9 impos\u00e9e se saisit en cru ou en cuit", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "front/src/solveur/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Chaque reste est ramen\u00e9 \u00e0 l'\u00e9tat dans lequel ses valeurs nutritionnelles ont un sens ; le r\u00e9sultat annonce toujours aCuire et assiette."}, {"id": "front_src_solveur_readme_arrondi_avant_macros", "label": "L'arrondi est appliqu\u00e9 AVANT le calcul des macros", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "front/src/solveur/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ce que tu lis \u00e0 l'\u00e9cran est ce que la balance mesurera : un test recompose les totaux \u00e0 partir des seules quantit\u00e9s annonc\u00e9es."}, {"id": "front_src_solveur_readme_jamais_negatif", "label": "Jamais de quantit\u00e9 n\u00e9gative", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "front/src/solveur/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "La variable est fix\u00e9e \u00e0 z\u00e9ro et le syst\u00e8me r\u00e9duit est r\u00e9solu en privil\u00e9giant prot\u00e9ines et glucides, l'\u00e9cart se reportant sur les lipides."}, {"id": "front_src_solveur_readme_diagnostic", "label": "Toute d\u00e9viation est expliqu\u00e9e (aucun ok:false sans diagnostic)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "front/src/solveur/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Le d\u00e9faut le plus grave de la premi\u00e8re version \u00e9tait de bloquer l\u00e0 o\u00f9 il fallait informer : les trois variables sont facultatives."}, {"id": "front_src_solveur_readme_negligeable", "label": "Aliment n\u00e9gligeable sous 8 g", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "front/src/solveur/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Le solveur le signale au lieu d'afficher \u00ab 1 g de thon \u00bb sans explication."}, {"id": "front_src_solveur_readme_substitution", "label": "Substituer sans toucher \u00e0 la di\u00e8te \u2014 36 combinaisons v\u00e9rifi\u00e9es", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "front/src/solveur/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Remplacer un aliment ne change pas que sa propre quantit\u00e9 : passer de la patate douce au quinoa fait baisser le saumon."}, {"id": "front_src_solveur_readme_garanties", "label": "garanties.test.ts \u2014 test de propri\u00e9t\u00e9 sur 5 000 combinaisons", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "front/src/solveur/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "76 % tombent dans la tol\u00e9rance ; les 24 % restants sont des combinaisons r\u00e9ellement impossibles, toutes accompagn\u00e9es d'un diagnostic."}, {"id": "front_src_solveur_readme_kcal_derivees", "label": "Les kcal ne sont pas une contrainte ind\u00e9pendante", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "front/src/solveur/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Elles d\u00e9coulent des macros : si une cible kcal ne correspond pas \u00e0 ses propres macros, aucune combinaison ne peut satisfaire les deux. Le solveur respecte les macros et signale l'incoh\u00e9rence."}, {"id": "front_src_solveur_readme_systeme_singulier", "label": "Trois aliments au profil trop proche rendent le syst\u00e8me singulier", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "front/src/solveur/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Le cas est d\u00e9tect\u00e9 et signal\u00e9, mais pas contourn\u00e9 : il faut choisir des aliments aux profils diff\u00e9rents."}, {"id": "front_src_solveur_readme_periode", "label": "periode.ts \u2014 plusieurs jours sur un stock qui d\u00e9cro\u00eet", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "front/src/solveur/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "front_src_solveur_readme_solveur", "target": "front_src_solveur_readme_algebre_gauss", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "front/src/solveur/README.